        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI9aKLYKC-aJtW5OLT8fxCsXTkk8Z10lVkkR46C0wts8kB2Vw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "một năm trước",
        "text": "Great apartment building and amazing management. Their is a local market nearby as well as many coffee shops and restaurants. However, if you have children or care about peace and quiet, do not rent an apartment here! Every building surrounding this apartment complex loves to blast karaoke, not just the weekend, weekdays too. Sometimes the noise would make the walls shake. The tenants of the poorly run building nest to this one like to have very loud arguments with each other and sometimes even blash music at 7 am in the morning. During the 6 months I lived there, there were 3 different construction sites nearby. I believe that 2 of them are still ongoing.",
